  "description": "Compute and return the square root of x, where x is non-negative.",
  "target": 8,
  "pseudocode": "1. left = 1, right = x\n2. while left <= right:\n3.   mid = left + floor((right - left) / 2)\n4.   if mid * mid > x: right = mid - 1\n5.   else if mid * mid < x: left = mid + 1\n6.   else: return mid\n7. return right",
  "steps": [
